# controls a Mox Ruby. The Forest, the Elves and Bot1's own Mox are not candidates (the refusals); the Sol Ring is, and is
# destroyed. Turn 5 she connects again with no counter left: nothing is asked (! Bot1.Accept) and the Mox Pearl survives.

